<section xmlns="https://code.dccouncil.us/schemas/dc-library" xmlns:codified="https://code.dccouncil.us/schemas/codified" xmlns:codify="https://code.dccouncil.us/schemas/codify" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <prefix>§</prefix>
  <num>47-2853.100b</num>
  <heading proof="needed">Representations and advertising.</heading>
  <para>
    <num>(a)</num>
    <text>Unless licensed in accordance with <cite path="47|28|I-B|F-ii">this part</cite>, no person shall use the words or terms "licensed glazier" or any words to imply that the person is licensed to perform the services of a glazier in the District.</text>
  </para>
